<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '24px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>方法总览：一帧进来，走完七步</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>04 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '8px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>设计哲学一句话：<b>每帧做小事，偶尔做一次大事</b>。前者保证实时，后者保证不漂；每一步都对应上一页的一个病症。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>①</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 3 }}>全局检索</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>全局描述子算余弦，取 top-20 候选帧</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>治“乱”</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>②</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 3 }}>局部粗筛</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>XFeat 比内点数，20 → 5 个候选</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>治“乱”</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>③</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 3 }}>精验建边</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>LightGlue ＋ RANSAC，内点 &gt; 500 才建边</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>治“乱”</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>④</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 3 }}>贪心选窗</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>式 1 贪心扩张到 N = 20 帧</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>定变量范围</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>⑤</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 3 }}>局部 BA</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#D6E4F7', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>LM ＋ Schur 补，解出位姿与三维点</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>重建本体</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>⑥</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 3 }}>回环修正</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>图距 &gt; 10 触发，Sim(3) 沿主干摊开</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>治“漂”</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 11px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>⑦</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 3 }}>高斯落位</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>分块深度对齐 ＋ 层级按屏幕尺寸合并</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>治“爆”</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '20px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>数据流：<b>关键帧图像</b>　→　<b>加权协视图 G</b>　→　<b>位姿 T_i / 三维点 X_j</b>　→　<b>高斯集合</b>　→　<b>渐进层级</b></Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>前三步只产出“约束”，第四五步只产出“位姿”，第六步修位姿，第七步才碰辐射场。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '5px 12px', marginTop: 3 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>时间账</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}><b>单帧延迟</b>　前端 27.8 ＋ 局部 BA 40.5 ＋ 高斯/层级 → 论文 <b>324 ms</b>（峰值 386）·　本次实测平均 <b>311 ms</b>、中位 87 ms、最慢 1.72 s</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}><b>全流程</b>　85 张 <b>54.5 s</b>（ds=1）/ 30.9 s（ds=2）　←　离线 COLMAP＋3DGS 同场景 <b>8 min 50 s</b>，本文 1 min 17 s，<b>快 6.9×</b></Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}><b>immediate 的含义</b>　单帧 &lt; 1 秒，够边拍边判断要不要补拍；<b>不是</b> 30 fps 视频——渲染 480 fps 是 3DGS 自带的，不算本文贡献</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '9px 16px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}><b>节奏</b>　①–⑤ 与 ⑦ 每个关键帧都跑；<b>⑥ 只在检测到回环时跑</b>——“每帧做小事、偶尔做一次大事”的具体分工。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #D6DCE5', padding: '9px 16px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}><b>容错</b>　匹配失败的帧先“搁置”，后续出现相似帧时再取出重试——乱序输入因此不必强求一次成功。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '6px 40px 12px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>接下来七页，一步一页：每页都是「这步在做什么 → 长什么样 → 核心公式 → 超参取值 → 为什么这么做」。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
